    "final": "Lowest buyable size M price for the Wexcombe tee: $13.02, charged by Carnforth Textile Company (http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-24.html). I opened all 45 Wexcombe tee listings across both search pages (36 on page 1 + 9 on page 2) and checked the size dropdown and per-size price on each. Size M could actually be bought on 22 listings; the cheapest was Carnforth Textile Company at $13.02 (verified live: selecting M shows $13.02, stock says In stock, Add to Cart enabled). Cheaper-looking M prices were not buyable: e.g. Whitlock Outfitters $12.85, Kettering Apparel $11.61, Fairhaven Apparel $14.49, Oakfield $14.06, Marchmont $18.23, Ambleside $21.37, Westmere $23.42, Gisburn $24.87, Redhill $26.98, Holbeck $33.83, Stonebridge $33.06 all had size M disabled (out of stock); 12 listings (Dovercourt, Foxcombe, Kelsall, Fenwick, Haldane, Everleigh, Copperfield, Oakhurst, Ingleton, Ashgrove, Abbotsley, Elmsworth) offered no size M at all.",
